  "slug": "apollo",
  "name": "Apollo",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Prospect, enrich leads, load outreach sequences, and query sales analytics with Apollo.io — one-click MCP server integration for Claude Code and Cowork.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `analytics` (Instant sales analytics), `enrich-lead` (Instant lead enrichment), `prospect` (Full ICP-to-leads pipeline), `sequence-load` (Find leads matching criteria and bulk-add them to an Apollo outreach sequence)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `apollo`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install apollo@claude-plugins-official` from `apolloio/apollo-mcp-plugin`.",
